<title>USA: Superior Supplements sees $4 mln in sales.</title>
<headline>Superior Supplements sees $4 mln in sales.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superior Supplements Inc said Tuesday it projects fourth quarter sales to be about $2 million.</p>
<p>The company said sales a year ago for the period April 24 through June 30 totaled $860,000.</p>
<p>The company said 35 percent of the sales will be from new customers.</p>
<p>The company also said its plant is fully operational.</p>
</text>
